WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.105
Verify land.

2
00:00:01.105 --> 00:00:05.398
Use the khatian and dag numbers to see if the land is on record.

3
00:00:05.398 --> 00:00:08.819
You also see whether it has a case or other claims.

4
00:00:09.773 --> 00:00:10.341
Step 1.

5
00:00:10.341 --> 00:00:11.639
Choose the area.

6
00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:13.019
Open Verify land.

7
00:00:13.019 --> 00:00:16.670
Pick the district and upazila from the lists.

8
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.698
Then type the mouza name.

9
00:00:19.653 --> 00:00:20.163
Step 2.

10
00:00:20.163 --> 00:00:22.640
Enter the khatian and dag numbers.

11
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.773
Type the khatian number and the dag number.

12
00:00:25.773 --> 00:00:28.323
Bangla or English digits both work.

13
00:00:28.323 --> 00:00:29.635
Then press Verify.

14
00:00:30.586 --> 00:00:31.075
Step 3.

15
00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:32.613
Read the short result.

16
00:00:32.613 --> 00:00:37.576
The result shows how many owners there are and whether there is a case.

17
00:00:37.576 --> 00:00:39.744
Sign in to see the full report.
